// CACHE: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits | owner=CodeEditorLand | repo=Sky | per_page=5 | page=25 → GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits.RESPONSE.map(Author,Date,File,Message,SHA)
